    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3942cfd4dc9bd72008da769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2814acf58cca54d150211830eeae5640e61a7c568c13143d2e948409a8072f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab92f48d58ccc601167dc60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是想为了你好！　为了你的梦想……\r\n为了达成经典三冠，只有通过那种方法……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56637c76022e598e809d1a18faed7ddaeae68a4d6e80e383adb5116fda9358ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f672f031d981ed96ed99e7d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我每每想到要去背负起她们的人生时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e280848650c6d956ca5c89769580e35cd73ef34a4a267a492ba74673937c5113",
