      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3539238277ffdc32fe9a39f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……嘛，这点也不是不能理解啊。毕竟来这所学园的马娘\r\n都是些为了能在闪耀系列赛上活跃而赌上人生的孩子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6dc2361db0f78c8c1a5260cfac0cd8a16a4c15eed9b15a593c8677cbfe7bff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
