      "uid": "zhcn:22bd7b8866bf853557d9a8ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话是那么说，但你也别太为这种事烦恼咯。\r\n因为找不到签约赛马娘而被辞退，你可就笑不出来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9269826bf596e65e7a367d739954fc24f523592b437821ab978d7bac5a659047",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
