    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8696bc10a3a99e9e1bd1e74b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光烦恼也不是办法。从明天起好好调整一下心态吧。\r\n我下定了这样的决心，向着车站走――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebc119a40627b8558f4dbb5b9674c639209df33859e52e727e7307c8b371c37d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
