    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14495370cf28486d617dc6c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑过来的那个打工的孩子递过来的是……\r\n一部看起来很眼熟的手机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b16aa2b4e7e58bfea4e409f936aafae8a1f36ee0a4aeb68d19d00053d888f9d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
