    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f88ed92f488b03356575d0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等、等一下……呵呵，啊哈哈！\r\n真是的ー，忘拿手机也是，你还真是冒失呢ー！　啊哈，啊哈哈……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa7140a8a4291467324573345c5f6534caaba7fd0e9bcfc60b7f0f0990b4e932",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
