    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbea878f0ddd38feda9b9afb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神笑了一会儿……\r\n然后，向我伸出了右手――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a153721a5623ab12a60d0da6c0c66296b1dc6ce0c20e08740d28471c23543b2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
