    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fd26b75f824117e2b80999e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一场艾尼斯风神领先数人的模拟赛。比赛已经进入到\r\n最终弯道，后方的马娘们开始一口气加速了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ef604c3d3f34919c12855c8f8dcb4e9e49bcbed0ae5982d49f4bf52afabcee5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
