      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被赶超的艾尼斯风神跟前几天看到的爽朗的样子完全不同，\r\n她瞪圆的双眼炯炯有神，露出了野兽般的笑容。然后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c2314acbafb7b1a237ad097fcafa3271144bfa0378ab4d0443a8fca02db04b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
