      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――我意识到自己被她吸引住了。我想要近距离看到她的未来，\r\n想要立马去跟她签约。然而――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9506eee29752780b73fef03a8d855a806f38a10e8ed0aecf50a7e50b3867fe38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd9f61f0e5641322ed8e37af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我脑海里突然闪过了这句话。然后，仿佛是在追问自己一样，\r\n那天那名马娘的话和她的表情又重现了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "535bcaf94d8bb5f02c525df9718bbb79df91dd1050735d8d48538534825ea42b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1574c4bc88c4e5991b1c00f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "缠着绷带的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e76f3011a003b03ad2c753d5469be6fe9a748004923432fe2e8d2d8a239219",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d5a1a553022c39f73dccba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还不如不跟你相遇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38726fd794397ef36640bda370a08be2d1c1eae0be27a6ed5fb89e5491ab68ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eccd306290621fcb3cb5b852",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我迈出的脚步又收了回去……\r\n在我思考的同时，艾尼斯风神已经离开了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c70cbd991a1e2681be3a94663285c836cfe337799138d9cd8c14707fcd125d68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97f55b2f81b787e093f958be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这让我深切感受到，马娘的实力能发展到\r\n什么程度，取决于训练员的水平――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d1d1ca863b3c4cf01b20a4009199ddd0dec1e69e2c739ef09ceb88aae5ee7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3a0983238932460f0759a67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那名马娘离开时落下的泪水，\r\n烙印在我脑海中挥之不去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1c926bca71229a54906d4869794b4946c1252bf18f958fe48c14b254817f4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80523e277d1c0ac08962f055",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dc9369440a9b696bdc605b98c8ab781a251bb4149a0083c969293a17093fbba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1031/storytimeline_041031001.json",
